purpose: Custom React hooks for reusable logic and state management
common_tasks:
  - Creating data fetching hooks
  - Implementing state management hooks
  - Adding UI interaction hooks
  - Wrapping service calls in hooks
  - Managing side effects
  - Composing multiple hooks
watch_out_for:
  - Follow Rules of Hooks strictly
  - Hooks must start with 'use'
  - No conditional hook calls
  - Proper dependency arrays
  - Clean up effects
  - Avoid infinite loops
related_files:
  - /src/services/* (services wrapped by hooks)
  - /src/contexts/* (contexts used by hooks)
  - /src/components/* (components using hooks)
  - @tanstack/react-query (data fetching)
test_command: npm run test:unit
key_patterns:
  - Use React Query for server state
  - Return consistent object shape
  - Handle loading and error states
  - Memoize callbacks and values
  - Proper TypeScript generics